1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Idha konjam diagrammatic-ah explain panren.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:04,900
Idha 20-20-60 split-nu solluvaanga.

3
00:00:04,900 --> 00:00:10,500
Ippo oru category of people, adhaavadhu first 20 percentage of the people,
Never Buy category-kulla varuvaanga.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,800
Ivanga yen inga irukkaanga-nu avangalukkum theriyaadhu, namakkum theriyaadhu.

5
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:16,800
Ivangalukku need irukkaadhu, ivangalaala pay panna mudiyaadhu,

6
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,500
and at the same time, ivangalukku namma idha evlo kashtappattu sell pannaalum,
ivanga kandippaa vaanga maattaanga.

7
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,400
So, ivangalukku namma efforts poduradhu-ndradhe waste of time.
So, ivangalukku sales thevaiye kidaiyaadhu.

8
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:29,600
And innoru 20 percentage of people, Definitely Buy.

9
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:35,000
Ivanga eppadi-naa Amazon purchasers maadhiri.
Ippo namma vandhu oru Amazon-la oru porul vaangurom appadinaa,

10
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,800
ippo vaangurom—cart-la podrathu kidaiyaadhu—vaangurom appadinaa,
oru porul venum-nu decide pannuvom, poi product-ah paappom,

11
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:44,800
search pannuvom, description paappom, details nallaa irukkaa-nu paappom,
features-laam nallaa irukkaa-nu paappom,

12
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,000
paatthuttu nallaa irukkaa, purchase pannittu vandhutte iruppom.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Adhe maadhiri dhaan ivangalum.
Nammala patthi, namma website, namma enna sell panrom-ngradha patthi,

14
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:58,000
and namma dhaan venum appadindra maadhiri ellaathaiyum paatthuttu,
decide pannittu, nammakitta lead-ah vandhiruppaanga.

15
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:03,200
So, ivangakitta product-oda features-ah kashtappattu sell pannanum
appadindra maadhiri-laam oru avasiyamum kidaiyaadhu.

16
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:08,500
Enna irukku, evlo-nu sonnaa podhum, kandippaa vaangirvaanga.
Ivanga Definitely Buy category-kulla varuvaanga.

17
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:13,400
Aanaa, innoru 60 percentage of people irukkaanga.
Ivanga dhaan Confused Buyers.

18
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:18,400
So, ivangalukku first indha product mela need irukkaa illaiyaa,
yaarukitta vaanguradhu,

19
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:21,500
and vaanginaa use pannuvaangalaa maattaangalaa,

20
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,800
and ippo adhu avangalukku thevaiyaa illa future-la thevaiyaa,
illa idhukku badhilaa avangalukku vera edhaavadhu thevaiyaa,

21
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:30,600
indha maadhiri multiple confusions irukkum,
and ivangalukku decision making-la oru help thevaippadum.

22
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:36,200
And yaaraavadhu help pannaa mattum dhaan ivangalukku edhu thevai,
thevai illai-ne decide panna mudiyum-ndra oru situation-la iruppaanga.

23
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:39,500
Ivangalukkaaga dhaan sales appadindra oru vishayame exist aagudhu.

24
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:43,686
Adhaavadhu, confusion-la irukkavangalukku clarity kodutthu,
decision making-la help panradhukku.